[en.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_MILITARY]
Canterlot Military Base

[en.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_MILITARY_desc]
The capital of a country without any military defense is definitely a stupid idea. Meanwhile, the capital of a country encapsulated inside a military base, which is... well, not a terribly stupid idea.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_MILITARY]
坎特洛特军事基地

[zh.FOCUS_C01_CANTERLOT_MILITARY_desc]
一个国家的首都却没有任何军事防备能力，绝对是一个愚蠢的主意。一个国家的首都被包围在军事基地里，这才是一个...嗯，不是特别愚蠢的主意。

